  "description": "Host-side orchestration of parameter studies for every solver family the host knows - CalculiX decks and OpenFOAM cases - with one activity vocabulary: validates the study and its family block up front, fans each chunk out with Grid.ForEach to the family's node activity, and harvests the results into a manifest blob after every chunk, each row the sweep's verdict and the node's own result, so partial results are first-class and progress is observable while the sweep runs. Progressive chunk sizing: the first chunk as wide as the fleet, geometric growth to a cap.",
